Package: alphen-box
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ultra-lightweight container runtime for Alphen OS (ARM64)
 Minimal, high-performance OCI-compliant container runtime designed
 specifically for 64-bit ARM Linux (Raspberry Pi 4/5, SBCs, ARM servers).
 Provides Docker-compatible CLI and sub-5MB idle RSS footprint.
